Oh!

7
00:00:06,367 --> 00:00:07,377
It has started to come in view.

8
00:00:08,077 --> 00:00:09,107
Sinbad!

9
00:00:11,827 --> 00:00:12,457
I know.

10
00:00:24,077 --> 00:00:25,767
Sasan Kingdom, huh...!?

11
00:00:26,677 --> 00:00:28,707
I guess we have no choice but to pass this mountain range on foot.

12
00:00:29,687 --> 00:00:31,947
Just what are we up to in this country!?

13
00:00:32,307 --> 00:00:36,857
Sasan, has the most abundance of top quality metal in the world,

14
00:00:37,397 --> 00:00:40,937
but have secluded themselves to the outer world up until now.

15
00:00:41,537 --> 00:00:45,227
However it seems that they've finally complied to the dealing of metal with Reim.

16
00:00:45,887 --> 00:00:50,027
If we are the first to bind an all out trading route with them,

17
00:00:50,217 --> 00:00:51,647
we'll gain huge profit.

18
00:00:52,597 --> 00:00:55,517
But you know, was it really alright

19
00:00:55,737 --> 00:00:59,127
to leave everything to Vittel and Mahad there!?

20
00:00:59,707 --> 00:01:00,707
Rurumu might be there,

21
00:01:01,047 --> 00:01:04,047
But she won't be able to help much because of babysitting and all.

22
00:01:05,107 --> 00:01:06,137
It'll be fine.

23
00:01:07,407 --> 00:01:10,567
Vittel is doing his best as a financial advisor,

24
00:01:11,207 --> 00:01:14,487
Plus Mahad might not be that talkative but he's good at taking care of people.

25
00:01:14,557 --> 00:01:15,917
Both are very much liked by everyone.

26
00:01:17,067 --> 00:01:17,717
Besides,

27
00:01:18,287 --> 00:01:19,717
It's a country we're visiting for the first time.

28
00:01:20,357 --> 00:01:23,557
The head himself has to go, right!?

29
00:01:24,377 --> 00:01:25,557
Now, let's go!

30
00:01:27,677 --> 00:01:28,617
You say all that,

31
00:01:28,817 --> 00:01:30,727
but you just wanted to go on an adventure, didn't you!?

32
00:01:32,217 --> 00:01:34,637
My body is trembling with excitement to see what kind of country this is.

33
00:01:34,797 --> 00:01:36,907
Geez, such a child you are.

34
00:01:42,217 --> 00:01:43,287
That's the summit over there.

35
00:01:47,837 --> 00:01:48,707
So we're finally here...

36
00:01:51,657 --> 00:01:52,887
To the Land of Purity...

37
00:01:53,927 --> 00:01:55,237
...Sasan Kingdom.

38
00:01:57,217 --> 00:02:02,047
It won't end until my heartbeat stops

