8194
00:03:26,707 --> 00:03:29,007
Land of Purity : Sasan

8195
00:03:33,927 --> 00:03:35,647
Sasan Kingdom.

8196
00:03:36,627 --> 00:03:39,807
A small country which is build on the base of a high altitude mountain.

8197
00:03:40,847 --> 00:03:44,867
They who were still devoted to the teachings of the old gods,

8198
00:03:45,247 --> 00:03:48,927
severed their interaction with the polluted outside world.

8199
00:03:49,947 --> 00:03:50,927
By doing so,

8200
00:03:50,927 --> 00:03:53,907
they got a second name as the "Land of Purity".

8201
00:03:55,067 --> 00:03:56,427
Wow!

8202
00:03:57,287 --> 00:03:58,627
Amazing!

8203
00:03:58,847 --> 00:04:01,707
We need to get this at any cost.

8204
00:04:01,707 --> 00:04:02,967
They're from the outside world.

8205
00:04:04,567 --> 00:04:06,467
Heretics from the outside world.

8206
00:04:06,747 --> 00:04:08,187
Don't get too close to them.

8207
00:04:10,967 --> 00:04:15,607
People who've come from outside, are forbidden to recklessly hold conversation with the people.

8208
00:04:16,547 --> 00:04:17,507
Please follow me!

8209
00:04:20,487 --> 00:04:21,547
Not happening!

8210
00:04:22,227 --> 00:04:25,627
Sasan, doesn't have any intention whatsoever of trading with any other country.

8211
00:04:26,067 --> 00:04:27,627
Now, please go back!

8212
00:04:27,807 --> 00:04:29,627
I beg your pardon,

8213
00:04:29,867 --> 00:04:33,047
But, a portion of Iron and other mineral resources from Sasan

8214
00:04:33,227 --> 00:04:35,227
have already been sent to Reim.

8215
00:04:35,487 --> 00:04:37,767
Rather than trading,

8216
00:04:37,867 --> 00:04:43,387
it's more like an amount we closed as a proof of friendship between the two countries.

8217
00:04:43,807 --> 00:04:47,987
The Emperor of Reim has been showing great interest and understanding in our beliefs.

8218
00:04:48,247 --> 00:04:51,867
Besides, the resources of Sasan are something we got from the blessings of god.

8219
00:04:52,527 --> 00:04:54,887
They're certainly not meant for the money making heretics.

8220
00:04:55,507 --> 00:04:57,787
If you understand that, then please leave.

8221
00:04:58,047 --> 00:04:59,307
That'sâ

8222
00:04:59,907 --> 00:05:01,567
In that case, please tell me.

8223
00:05:02,227 --> 00:05:08,107
How can I get on friendly terms with Sasan, not as a trader but as a single man.

8224
00:05:08,707 --> 00:05:11,287
I wish to understand and share both

8225
00:05:11,567 --> 00:05:15,147
your culture and beliefs from the bottom of my heart.

8226
00:05:16,447 --> 00:05:19,347
Just what can I do for your country...

8227
00:05:19,927 --> 00:05:21,567
Please tell me.

8228
00:05:23,827 --> 00:05:28,167
Sasan welcomes the same minded people and doesn't refuse an adherent believer.

8229
00:05:28,607 --> 00:05:34,327
IIf you really want to get on friendly terms with Sasan, then visit Sasan Knights.

8230
00:05:35,207 --> 00:05:36,487
Sasan Knights!?

8231
00:05:42,887 --> 00:05:43,947
Amazing indeed.

8232
00:05:44,627 --> 00:05:50,587
Sasan Knights are the high-ranking clergymen who synthesized Sasan's doctrine

8233
00:05:50,807 --> 00:05:53,767
and are an absolute existence who protect its citizens.

8234
00:05:54,587 --> 00:06:00,627
Even among them, Knight King, Darius Leoxses is the most prominent knight.

8235
00:06:01,167 --> 00:06:05,327
I am sure Sasan will accept you if you're to be acknowledged by him.

8236
00:06:10,007 --> 00:06:11,327
Excuse me!

8237
00:06:11,887 --> 00:06:13,607
Nice to meet you,

8238
00:06:13,787 --> 00:06:14,787
Just what are you doingâ

8239
00:06:15,007 --> 00:06:19,327
We'll be kicked out of this country if we're rude to these Knights.

8240
00:06:15,247 --> 00:06:17,987
Excuse me! Excuse me!!

8241
00:06:19,647 --> 00:06:21,627
It'll be fine, just leave it to me!

8242
00:06:22,067 --> 00:06:28,067
Nice to meet you, I am a trader from Reim called Sinbad.

8243
00:06:28,327 --> 00:06:29,227
I came here todayâ

8244
00:06:29,267 --> 00:06:31,207
Insolent fellow! 
Get back this instant!

8245
00:06:33,147 --> 00:06:34,727
See, I warned you.

8246
00:06:35,007 --> 00:06:37,927
No, we came here on friendly terms

8247
00:06:38,187 --> 00:06:39,447
and are not suspicious in any wayâ

8248
00:06:39,567 --> 00:06:41,687
If he opposes then just cut him.

8249
00:06:42,207 --> 00:06:42,867
Wait!

8250
00:06:44,347 --> 00:06:47,707
Don't taint your lance by cutting a man who knows his manners.

8251
00:06:50,407 --> 00:06:51,267
Let's go!

8252
00:07:01,287 --> 00:07:03,087
Excuse me!

8253
00:07:03,307 --> 00:07:05,687
Please let me in as a Knight!

8254
00:07:08,447 --> 00:07:09,407
Huh!?

8255
00:07:10,247 --> 00:07:12,467
I grew up with this dream to be a Knight!

8256
00:07:12,607 --> 00:07:15,007
Oh look, Knight King is waving his hand from there.

8257
00:07:15,287 --> 00:07:17,927
Alright, in that case I'll just enter from the front doorâ

8258
00:07:20,287 --> 00:07:22,167
Like I said, I am not anyone suspicious!

8259
00:07:22,187 --> 00:07:23,887
Alert others, there is a suspicious person lurking here.

8260
00:07:24,527 --> 00:07:26,167
RâRun away!

8261
00:07:29,707 --> 00:07:32,167
Damn that was hilarious how they didn't even bother with you.

8262
00:07:33,447 --> 00:07:37,687
Yeah, I never thought that the bunch in the order would be that inflexible.

8263
00:07:37,787 --> 00:07:41,207
Obviously, holding a direct dialogue like that is going too overboard.

8264
00:07:41,487 --> 00:07:44,527
It won't be weird if they drive us out of this country, you know!?

8265
00:07:44,867 --> 00:07:46,067
Have a bit self awareness ofâ

8266
00:07:45,967 --> 00:07:46,367
Alright!

8267
00:07:46,687 --> 00:07:48,647
I'll definitely make it successful next time.

8268
00:07:49,047 --> 00:07:52,407
That's great, are we going to talk with our fists next!?

8269
00:07:52,847 --> 00:07:54,527
In that case, leave it to me!

8270
00:07:54,607 --> 00:07:56,967
No, they'll understand once we speak with them.

8271
00:07:57,327 --> 00:07:59,287
Besides, we're not doing anything wrong anyways.

8272
00:07:59,507 --> 00:08:01,167
Are you even listening to me!?

8273
00:08:01,407 --> 00:08:04,327
I'm telling you to stop getting involved with the Knight Order.

8274
00:08:04,727 --> 00:08:06,327
Hinahoho-dono, stop boarding in his ideas as well.

8275
00:08:06,567 --> 00:08:07,447
Well, calm down for a bit!

8276
00:08:08,087 --> 00:08:12,207
We're forbidden to leave this institute build especially for foreigners at night anyways.

8277
00:08:13,047 --> 00:08:14,967
Even so, there aren't many people here...

8278
00:08:15,727 --> 00:08:21,607
It must be to prevent the people from interacting with us foreigners.

8279
00:08:22,527 --> 00:08:26,447
There has been no major development, we're seriously cornered.

8280
00:08:26,967 --> 00:08:31,167
Don't be that pessimistic, let's take it steadily.

8281
00:08:31,647 --> 00:08:32,367
Sin...

8282
00:08:33,147 --> 00:08:36,367
Besides, the level of exposure is surely regretting but,

8283
00:08:36,767 --> 00:08:40,407
the women here in Sasan, are the epitome of modest beauty.

8284
00:08:40,907 --> 00:08:41,787
Women, huh!?

8285
00:08:42,007 --> 00:08:43,127
Women, is it!?

8286
00:08:44,527 --> 00:08:46,127
Hey there, Mr. Traveler!

8287
00:08:46,307 --> 00:08:48,247
I have a small request.

8288
00:08:48,787 --> 00:08:51,087
Can I join you on this seat!?

8289
00:08:51,527 --> 00:08:53,327
If you want an empty seat, the whole place is nearly empty.

8290
00:08:53,487 --> 00:08:54,907
You don't really have to bother yourself with us!

8291
00:08:54,987 --> 00:08:56,927
No no no, you don't get it.

8292
00:08:57,047 --> 00:08:59,967
I just want to have a conversation with you all.

8293
00:09:00,247 --> 00:09:01,327
Stop that!

8294
00:09:01,587 --> 00:09:04,087
This is an institute build especially for the foreigners.

8295
00:09:04,127 --> 00:09:05,927
Locals are not allowed to enter here.

8296
00:09:05,967 --> 00:09:08,327
Just how many times do I have to repeat myself so you can get that!?

8297
00:09:08,327 --> 00:09:11,007
I know. But atleast allow me to talk a bitâ

8298
00:09:11,067 --> 00:09:14,167
Not on my watch, just consider my position for once as well.

8299
00:09:14,247 --> 00:09:16,967
Don't you understand that you're an heir to the throne.

8300
00:09:17,767 --> 00:09:18,967
Son of the King, huh!?

8301
00:09:20,167 --> 00:09:23,147
This person is the son of the current Knight King, Darius-sama.

8302
00:09:23,327 --> 00:09:24,647
Mystras-sama.

8303
00:09:25,647 --> 00:09:30,647
Even I will get scolded if he learns that you're here.

8304
00:09:31,047 --> 00:09:33,047
With that said... please head back.

8305
00:09:33,047 --> 00:09:36,727
I don't wanna, finally someone interesting came to this country!

8306
00:09:36,727 --> 00:09:39,707
I plan on camping here, until I hear all about the outside world.

8307
00:09:40,167 --> 00:09:41,767
What are you saying!?

8308
00:09:42,087 --> 00:09:44,527
How can a knight like yourself break the prohibition!?

8309
00:09:44,527 --> 00:09:46,527
Now calm down for a second, Ojou-san!

8310
00:09:46,907 --> 00:09:49,767
It looks like he just wants to talk with us for a bit,

8311
00:09:50,467 --> 00:09:54,167
plus we'd be more than happy to speak with a knight of this country.

8312
00:09:54,967 --> 00:09:58,247
So would you mind overlooking it for a bit.

8313
00:10:00,887 --> 00:10:02,727
IâIf it's only for a bit...

8314
00:10:02,727 --> 00:10:04,727
Thank you so much, Ojou-san!

8315
00:10:04,827 --> 00:10:06,007
O' God...

8316
00:10:06,007 --> 00:10:07,527
That's Sin for you!

8317
00:10:08,527 --> 00:10:10,447
Here ya go, don't hold back on the food.

8318
00:10:10,447 --> 00:10:12,047
And drink to your heart's content!

8319
00:10:12,047 --> 00:10:14,687
Onee-san, bring the extra servings!

8320
00:10:17,147 --> 00:10:19,487
Still... you sure can stuff all of that into your body.

8321
00:10:19,487 --> 00:10:22,267
Knight's sentiment is to live with fortitude and vigor!

8322
00:10:22,327 --> 00:10:24,407
And food also comes in that principle.

8323
00:10:24,867 --> 00:10:27,327
It's been a while since I ate something this tasty.

8324
00:10:29,327 --> 00:10:30,727
It was delicious!

8325
00:10:31,207 --> 00:10:34,407
So, the reason you wanted to talk with us!?

8326
00:10:34,407 --> 00:10:36,407
and why are you so fixated on us!?

8327
00:10:37,727 --> 00:10:43,447
We from Sasan, are forbidden to leave the country because of the doctrine.

8328
00:10:43,967 --> 00:10:47,687
And since I am an apprentice knight, the precept is much more stricter for me.

8329
00:10:48,807 --> 00:10:49,967
That's why,

8330
00:10:50,167 --> 00:10:53,007
I want to know more about the outside world.

8331
00:10:57,327 --> 00:10:58,887
I'm Sinbad!

8332
00:10:59,527 --> 00:11:03,087
Head of the Sindria Corp. and also one of the Dungeon Conquerors!

8333
00:11:03,367 --> 00:11:04,887
An adventurer!

8334
00:11:05,367 --> 00:11:07,567
Dungeon... Conqueror...!?

8335
00:11:08,127 --> 00:11:09,567
It's a book I wrote myself.

8336
00:11:10,327 --> 00:11:14,167
As it's quite an evening, let's make this an enjoyable commemorative day of our encounter.

8337
00:11:23,847 --> 00:11:29,287
The tale of a man who repeatedly sails across high seas in search of new land and seas.

8338
00:11:30,127 --> 00:11:32,407
One who cleared the mysterious Dungeon

8339
00:11:32,407 --> 00:11:34,607
and acquired the Holy Power of the spirit,

8340
00:11:34,767 --> 00:11:40,447
The tale of that first adventurer, Sinbad will unravel here.

8341
00:11:46,007 --> 00:11:47,647
That was really something...

8342
00:11:47,867 --> 00:11:52,127
He was much more interesting than any other traveler...

8343
00:11:52,827 --> 00:11:56,167
You experienced this!? Even though you're almost the same age as me!?

8344
00:11:56,687 --> 00:11:58,167
Amazing...

8345
00:11:58,407 --> 00:12:02,947
There is no one like you in this confined country.

8346
00:12:03,927 --> 00:12:06,207
Do you dislike this country, Mystras!?

8347
00:12:07,087 --> 00:12:11,207
This country is firmly bound to it's doctrine and has no freedom whatsoever.

8348
00:12:11,727 --> 00:12:13,387
And is filled with serious and stiff people everywhere.

8349
00:12:14,807 --> 00:12:17,427
I would rather choose to breathe the outside air to my heart's content and die early,

8350
00:12:17,887 --> 00:12:22,647
than live a long life in this restricted place.

8351
00:12:27,207 --> 00:12:30,687
I also want to run around the world.

8352
00:12:31,247 --> 00:12:33,367
and touch those unknown lands.

8353
00:12:34,367 --> 00:12:37,207
I will definitely go to the outside world.

8354
00:12:34,757 --> 00:12:41,177
Visit us at
https://kamitranslation.wordpress.com/

8355
00:12:42,727 --> 00:12:47,247
I will be at their lodge in no time if I take a horse.

8356
00:12:48,487 --> 00:12:50,647
Where do you think you're going, Mystras!?

8357
00:12:52,247 --> 00:12:54,287
Strolling again without permission, are we!?

8358
00:12:54,667 --> 00:12:56,527
It looks like you slipped out last night as well.

8359
00:12:58,367 --> 00:13:01,767
You lack the self awareness of being the son of a Knight King!

8360
00:13:03,207 --> 00:13:04,247
Dad...

8361
00:13:05,087 --> 00:13:08,767
I know you've been interested in the outside world for quite some time now.

8362
00:13:09,367 --> 00:13:13,167
However, a proud knight of Sasan, isn't permitted to leave these lands.

8363
00:13:13,967 --> 00:13:16,767
Our doctrine is absolute to everything no matter what.

8364
00:13:17,967 --> 00:13:20,367
So abstain from doing as you please.

8365
00:13:21,327 --> 00:13:24,687
There are people in the order who're not that favourable about you.

8366
00:13:25,547 --> 00:13:29,687
Or, do you perhaps want to continue showing an unsightful sight to your younger brother!?

8367
00:13:30,207 --> 00:13:31,687
Spartos!?

8368
00:13:32,047 --> 00:13:35,207
I wanted you to instruct me on how to use lance...

8369
00:13:35,647 --> 00:13:38,327
But as you weren't in the room so...

8370
00:13:39,107 --> 00:13:40,187
I apologize.

8371
00:13:41,367 --> 00:13:46,527
Mystras, you're also at the age where you can enter the order formally as a knight.

8372
00:13:47,287 --> 00:13:51,367
So reflect on your doings and be a good example to your younger brother!

8373
00:13:52,267 --> 00:13:53,367
Do you get it!?

8374
00:13:54,727 --> 00:13:55,727
I don't want to!

8375
00:13:56,047 --> 00:13:57,887
I can't do it anymore.

8376
00:13:58,067 --> 00:14:00,447
I don't give a damn about being a Knight or the order.

8377
00:14:00,807 --> 00:14:02,807
I'm sick of this country!

8378
00:14:03,447 --> 00:14:07,287
To finish my life, living in some deep mountain like this.

8379
00:14:07,287 --> 00:14:09,407
I'll definitely not enter the order!

8380
00:14:19,247 --> 00:14:20,847
BâBig-Brother!!

8381
00:14:37,647 --> 00:14:38,527
I beg you...

8382
00:14:39,927 --> 00:14:41,727
...please take me along with you.

8383
00:14:42,567 --> 00:14:45,047
We'd very much like to do that but,

8384
00:14:45,567 --> 00:14:48,607
we came here to bind a trade route with Sasan.

8385
00:14:48,727 --> 00:14:49,847
That's why...

8386
00:14:50,327 --> 00:14:52,767
Who is it!?
Don't hide there and come out!

8387
00:14:56,327 --> 00:14:59,087
Spartos!? 
Why're you here!?

8388
00:14:59,547 --> 00:15:03,007
Big-Brother, I really respect you.

8389
00:15:03,667 --> 00:15:05,627
That's why please stay here in Sasan,

8390
00:15:06,087 --> 00:15:08,687
so that you can succeed father and become a Knight King...

8391
00:15:09,327 --> 00:15:13,407
As you're the only one who can properly reign over Sasan!

8392
00:15:15,527 --> 00:15:16,987
It'll be fine if you become one.

8393
00:15:17,647 --> 00:15:22,727
You heard me right!? 
That I don't want to die knowing such a small world.

8394
00:15:24,527 --> 00:15:26,967
Fine, I'll take you along with me.

8395
00:15:27,967 --> 00:15:30,487
However, I won't do it secretly.

8396
00:15:31,327 --> 00:15:33,927
So, you'll have to settle it by yourself.

8397
00:15:34,047 --> 00:15:35,927
Yes, I plan on doing that.

8398
00:15:36,327 --> 00:15:42,167
Sasan Knight's have a duty to dedicate themselves to Sasan while they live, once they take the pledge.

8399
00:15:42,667 --> 00:15:46,567
However, there is one way to leave the order while you're still alive.

8400
00:15:46,807 --> 00:15:48,207
Big-Brother you don't plan onâ

8401
00:15:48,487 --> 00:15:49,607
Spartos!

8402
00:15:50,167 --> 00:15:51,927
Go back and tell father,

8403
00:15:53,047 --> 00:15:55,967
that I plan on leaving the Knight Order officially.

8404
00:16:08,127 --> 00:16:09,247
Yo!

8405
00:16:09,687 --> 00:16:10,867
So you were here!?

8406
00:16:16,487 --> 00:16:19,107
There are things you don't want to say since he is your brother after all...

8407
00:16:20,487 --> 00:16:23,967
Well, at any rate fathers can be quite troublesome sometimes.

8408
00:16:25,367 --> 00:16:28,087
I am also a chief's son you see.

8409
00:16:28,567 --> 00:16:32,127
And have a close younger sibling as well, just like you.

8410
00:16:33,327 --> 00:16:35,167
It was really troublesome for me as well.

8411
00:16:36,107 --> 00:16:39,177
Well, in my case unlike you

8412
00:16:39,427 --> 00:16:42,377
I was quite afraid of going to the outside world.

8413
00:16:44,657 --> 00:16:46,547
However, in the end...

8414
00:16:47,447 --> 00:16:51,257
...fathers are an existence that you need to overcome somehow.

8415
00:16:54,767 --> 00:16:57,257
I wonder if that young man would be fine!?

8416
00:16:57,607 --> 00:16:59,257
Who knows!?

8417
00:16:59,807 --> 00:17:01,747
Well, I am sure he will be.

8418
00:17:06,407 --> 00:17:07,177
Hey!

8419
00:17:07,977 --> 00:17:11,287
Why the hell are you here... Yunan!?

8420
00:17:13,047 --> 00:17:14,207
Sinbad...

8421
00:17:15,487 --> 00:17:16,767
...you grew a bit old didn't you!?

8422
00:17:16,917 --> 00:17:20,427
No I didn't, I just grew a bit and got taller that's it!

8423
00:17:20,427 --> 00:17:22,057
Just look at how manly I've become.

8424
00:17:22,387 --> 00:17:24,227
I wonder about that.

8425
00:17:24,347 --> 00:17:26,627
Um... Sin, who is that person!?

8426
00:17:27,317 --> 00:17:31,257
He's a traveler who guided me to the Dungeon of Baal, two years ago.

8427
00:17:32,067 --> 00:17:34,057
I don't know who he is to be honest though.

8428
00:17:34,347 --> 00:17:35,607
You don't!?

8429
00:17:35,687 --> 00:17:40,107
Heh... that's so cruel! 
Even though I was always watching you.

8430
00:17:40,407 --> 00:17:42,857
You acquired the powers of another Djinn, didn't you!?

8431
00:17:43,007 --> 00:17:46,607
You even know about that!?
As usual you're a mystery to me.

8432
00:17:47,087 --> 00:17:49,107
So, what is it this time!?

8433
00:17:49,567 --> 00:17:51,857
You also know about it, don't you!?

8434
00:17:52,107 --> 00:17:56,107
That lately, Dungeons have started appearing at various places in the world.

8435
00:17:56,607 --> 00:18:02,207
I know. Ever since I conquered Baal, the reports of people witnessing them have increased quite a lot.

8436
00:18:02,547 --> 00:18:05,107
Yes and that's not limited to just adventurers,

8437
00:18:05,287 --> 00:18:08,857
but royalties from different countries and the ones in power have

8438
00:18:08,857 --> 00:18:11,507
started to challenge the Dungeon and acquire the power of the Djinn.

8439
00:18:11,987 --> 00:18:17,657
Big countries like Reim Empire, and Kou Empire that has risen to power just recently.

8440
00:18:18,107 --> 00:18:21,807
Small countries like Artemyra and Heliohapt.

8441
00:18:22,067 --> 00:18:23,307
Not to forget,

8442
00:18:23,307 --> 00:18:25,707
your birth place Partevia too.

8443
00:18:27,467 --> 00:18:29,807
Even this Sasan Kingdom as well.

8444
00:18:30,327 --> 00:18:34,247
You're not the only one who holds the power of Djinn now.

8445
00:18:34,347 --> 00:18:37,457
Um, even this country has a Conqueror!?

8446
00:18:37,757 --> 00:18:42,657
Yes, that'd be the person who holds the most influence in this country, Knight King Darius Leoxses.

8447
00:18:43,857 --> 00:18:49,757
How do you plan on facing the other conquerors, Sinbad!?

8448
00:18:50,707 --> 00:18:53,357
We just came here to discuss trade.

8449
00:18:53,587 --> 00:18:54,707
Is that so!?

8450
00:18:55,057 --> 00:18:58,827
In the first place, we came here in order to meet the Knight King,

8451
00:18:59,107 --> 00:19:01,507
so that we can discuss about trade.

8452
00:19:02,357 --> 00:19:06,527
So it doesn't matter if that Knight King is a conqueror or not.

8453
00:19:06,857 --> 00:19:09,607
If anything, it has become more exciting now.

8454
00:19:11,107 --> 00:19:13,957
You're interesting as usual.

8455
00:19:14,307 --> 00:19:17,207
I wonder what kind of reaction will the two conquerors make after meeting with each other.

8456
00:19:17,907 --> 00:19:19,567
I am seriously looking forward to it,

8457
00:19:21,357 --> 00:19:22,857
Sinbad!

8458
00:19:23,357 --> 00:19:24,347
He disappeared...!?

8459
00:19:25,147 --> 00:19:27,257
Sin, that person just vanised into thin air!

8460
00:19:38,457 --> 00:19:40,507
The winner is Mystras!

8461
00:19:40,507 --> 00:19:43,507
Amazing! To be able to defeat Holy Knights one after another.

8462
00:19:43,957 --> 00:19:46,107
Was he always that strong!?

8463
00:19:46,167 --> 00:19:48,757
The only one left now is the Knight King himself.

8464
00:19:49,527 --> 00:19:52,057
Now come, father!

8465
00:19:52,907 --> 00:19:54,707
I'll be a free man if I win!

8466
00:19:55,207 --> 00:19:57,357
That young man is serious.

8467
00:19:57,707 --> 00:20:02,107
According to that door guard, the loser will be beheaded.

8468
00:20:02,807 --> 00:20:03,807
I know.

8469
00:20:03,807 --> 00:20:06,757
Apprentice Knight Mystras Leoxses,

8470
00:20:07,257 --> 00:20:09,857
and Knight King Darius Leoxses,

8471
00:20:10,307 --> 00:20:14,327
pledge yourselves to abide by the doctrine of the gods.

8472
00:20:15,057 --> 00:20:15,857
Begin!

8473
00:20:22,007 --> 00:20:23,027
How's it, Dad!?

8474
00:20:23,287 --> 00:20:26,047
The taste of spearmanship that you taught me yourself!

8475
00:20:26,807 --> 00:20:29,007
I polished my skills without stopping,

8476
00:20:29,507 --> 00:20:31,807
Just for this day when I'll defeat you.

8477
00:20:32,807 --> 00:20:34,057
That was close.

8478
00:20:34,057 --> 00:20:35,807
Not bad!

8479
00:20:37,987 --> 00:20:41,307
Well I admit that you have enough power to boast.

8480
00:20:41,847 --> 00:20:44,307
However, an attack of this extentâ

8481
00:20:44,307 --> 00:20:45,857
Shut up!

8482
00:20:46,067 --> 00:20:47,287
Turn it back,

8483
00:20:47,407 --> 00:20:48,327
Alloces!

8484
00:20:58,747 --> 00:21:02,557
That's the Power of God that only a Knight King can use.

8485
00:21:02,587 --> 00:21:06,207
Knight King conquered that legendary Dungeon that only appears

8486
00:21:06,207 --> 00:21:10,757
when the world is surrounded by unusual phenomenon and acquired that power.

8487
00:21:11,607 --> 00:21:14,507
So that's the power of god.

8488
00:21:14,957 --> 00:21:16,367
I'm witnessing this for the first time

8489
00:21:16,987 --> 00:21:20,457
but then why does it feel that I've seen this power before!?

8490
00:21:21,947 --> 00:21:25,507
Shit, is this the power of god!?

8491
00:21:26,267 --> 00:21:28,377
In that case, it's do or die.

8492
00:21:29,857 --> 00:21:31,057
It won't work.

8493
00:21:33,657 --> 00:21:37,457
Let's see if you can dodge this!

8494
00:21:43,057 --> 00:21:48,207
Don't make me repeat myself.
Let's have you taste your own power!

8495
00:21:57,187 --> 00:21:58,357
Is this your limit?

8496
00:22:01,957 --> 00:22:04,507
As a minimal courtesy I'll make it painless,

8497
00:22:04,507 --> 00:22:06,157
Knight Mystras!

8498
00:22:06,157 --> 00:22:07,557
Big-Brother!!

8499
00:22:08,107 --> 00:22:10,357
Let me praise you for this duel!

8500
00:22:11,807 --> 00:22:14,457
Hold on a second there!

8501
00:22:35,497 --> 00:22:38,377
It's because my face was boring

8502
00:22:35,497 --> 00:22:38,377
kagami ni utsuru jibun ga

8503
00:22:38,377 --> 00:22:41,297
that I was reflected in the mirror like that

8504
00:22:38,377 --> 00:22:41,297
saenai kao wo shiteta kara

8505
00:22:41,297 --> 00:22:44,137
The dream I saw of flying in the sky

8506
00:22:41,297 --> 00:22:44,137
kinou mita sora wo tobu yume

8507
00:22:44,137 --> 00:22:46,927
has now started flowing inside my eyes

8508
00:22:44,137 --> 00:22:46,927
hitomi no oku de ugokidasu

8509
00:22:46,927 --> 00:22:49,807
If only I had a bit of courage

8510
00:22:46,927 --> 00:22:49,807
sukoshi no yuuki ga arunara

8511
00:22:49,807 --> 00:22:52,767
I could've flown at anytime

8512
00:22:49,807 --> 00:22:52,767
itsudemo tobidaseru no ni

8513
00:22:52,767 --> 00:22:58,397
A breeze rushed across the shore

8514
00:22:52,767 --> 00:22:58,397
oounabara ni kaze ga fuiteta yo

8515
00:22:58,397 --> 00:23:03,277
If you stretch your hands

8516
00:22:58,397 --> 00:23:03,277
te wo hirogereba

8517
00:23:03,277 --> 00:23:12,707
A new world will connect

8518
00:23:03,277 --> 00:23:12,707
atarashii sekai ga tsunagaru

8519
00:23:15,417 --> 00:23:20,927
Grasp your body and soul together!

8520
00:23:15,417 --> 00:23:20,927
zenshinzenrei subete wo tsukamu yo!

8521
00:23:20,927 --> 00:23:26,847
There is a new born hope in my hands

8522
00:23:20,927 --> 00:23:26,847
boku no tenonaka ni wa umaretate no kibou

8523
00:23:26,847 --> 00:23:32,477
I wonder what you could see

8524
00:23:26,847 --> 00:23:32,477
habataku tsubasa so nosaki ni

8525
00:23:32,477 --> 00:23:38,317
across those wings of yours? Will I ever know?

8526
00:23:32,477 --> 00:23:38,317
nani ga mieru? wakaru darou

8527
00:23:38,317 --> 00:23:43,947
Together with these feelings of mine

8528
00:23:38,317 --> 00:23:43,947
takanaru kimochi tomo ni

8529
00:23:43,947 --> 00:23:52,997
Let's start our journey!

8530
00:23:43,947 --> 00:23:52,997
kono mama ima tabi ni de yo

